<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Wednesday 106,000 -USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Wednesday 106,000 -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts Wednesday were 106,000 head, compared with the estimate of 105,000, USDA reported.</p>
<p>Opening trade was not well established. Early sales Barrows and Gilts were $0.50-$1.00 per cwt lower than the midsession Wednesday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    58.00 -58.50	   59.00 -59.50</p>
<p>few			57.50 -59.00	   58.50 -60.00</p>
<p>Sows:  steady to 4.00 lower.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  41.00 -45.00	   41.00 -45.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   44.00 -46.50	   44.00 -46.50</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    45.00 -48.00	   46.00 -48.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
